1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:06,968
Remy lives far away.

3
00:00:06,968 --> 00:00:09,867
He wants Maya's new drawing.

4
00:00:09,867 --> 00:00:13,484
Sammy walks it all the way across town.

5
00:00:13,484 --> 00:00:15,425
Remy waits.

6
00:00:15,425 --> 00:00:17,233
And waits.

7
00:00:17,233 --> 00:00:19,028
And waits.

8
00:00:19,028 --> 00:00:20,917
So slow!

9
00:00:20,917 --> 00:00:24,029
The first trip takes forever.

10
00:00:24,029 --> 00:00:26,529
Zip is the fast road.

11
00:00:26,529 --> 00:00:31,143
Zip keeps a copy at the edge of town, near Remy.

12
00:00:31,143 --> 00:00:35,212
Next time Remy asks... it is right there!

13
00:00:35,212 --> 00:00:36,928
Instant!

14
00:00:36,928 --> 00:00:39,654
Maya paints a new drawing.

15
00:00:39,654 --> 00:00:42,353
The old copy goes away.

16
00:00:42,353 --> 00:00:45,119
Zip fetches the fresh one.

17
00:00:45,119 --> 00:00:47,273
Remy smiles.

18
00:00:47,273 --> 00:00:49,255
Maya waves.

19
00:00:49,255 --> 00:00:51,449
Now you know Zip!

20
00:00:51,449 --> 00:00:56,143
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

